{"role":"module","name":"lib/bump/options.sh","payload":[{"role":"path","payload":"lib/bump/options.sh"},{"role":"reach","payload":"fragment"},{"role":"doc","payload":"The options struct ops git-bump hands bump__plan_bump, read as the questions a plan\nasks of it: which release level the flags name, which prerelease channel they\nname, whether a release was asked for at all, and whether the run is releasing\nthe prerelease it starts from.\n\nAn absent field reads as the answer \"no flag said so\", so a flagless run falls\nthrough every one of these to the auto bump."},{"role":"function","name":"__bump__is_release_bump","payload":[{"role":"line","payload":13},{"role":"contract","payload":[{"role":"visibility","payload":"private"}]}]},{"role":"function","name":"__bump__is_prerelease_bump","payload":[{"role":"line","payload":18},{"role":"contract","payload":[{"role":"visibility","payload":"private"}]}]},{"role":"function","name":"__bump__is_releasing_prerelease","payload":[{"role":"line","payload":23},{"role":"contract","payload":[{"role":"visibility","payload":"private"}]}]},{"role":"function","name":"__bump__release_type","payload":[{"role":"line","payload":38},{"role":"contract","payload":[{"role":"visibility","payload":"private"}]}]},{"role":"function","name":"__bump__prerelease_type","payload":[{"role":"line","payload":43},{"role":"contract","payload":[{"role":"visibility","payload":"private"}]}]},{"role":"function","name":"__bump__release_requested","payload":[{"role":"line","payload":48},{"role":"contract","payload":[{"role":"visibility","payload":"private"}]}]}]}
